1
00:00:00,647 --> 00:00:03,557
(Penny:)No. Did you figure out what you're
gonna do about the two girls?

2
00:00:03,717 --> 00:00:05,217
(Raj:)As a matter of fact, I did.

3
00:00:05,385 --> 00:00:08,055
(Raj:)I've spent so many years
living in fear,

4
00:00:08,221 --> 00:00:10,831
(Raj:)saying no to new experiences,
but from now on,

5
00:00:10,991 --> 00:00:13,131
(Raj:)I'm gonna say yes.
Yes to love,

6
00:00:13,293 --> 00:00:15,173
(Raj:)yes to adventure, yes to life.
Whatever it may be,

7
00:00:15,329 --> 00:00:16,869
(Raj:)the answer's going to be yes.

8
00:00:18,298 --> 00:00:19,368
(Howard:)He's gonna die alone, right?

9
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:21,013
(Penny:)-Yeah.
-Yes.

10
00:00:23,971 --> 00:00:25,241
(Amy:)I'm proud of you, Sheldon.

11
00:00:25,405 --> 00:00:26,885
(Sheldon:)You know, I'm proud of me, too.

12
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:30,390
(Sheldon:)I've done all my research,
I conducted an informal poll,

13
00:00:30,544 --> 00:00:32,254
(Sheldon:)and I've arrived
at the rock-solid certainty

14
00:00:32,412 --> 00:00:33,582
(Sheldon:)I've made the right choice.

15
00:00:33,747 --> 00:00:35,087
(Amy:)Well, that's got to be
a good feeling.

16
00:00:35,248 --> 00:00:36,658
(Sheldon:)Oh, it is.

17
00:00:36,817 --> 00:00:38,597
(Sheldon:)-Although--
-Oh, crap.

18
00:00:40,387 --> 00:00:43,597
(Sheldon:)I had the same feeling when
I made my dad buy a Betamax

19
00:00:43,757 --> 00:00:45,427
(Sheldon:)instead of a VHS.

20
00:00:45,759 --> 00:00:47,429
(Amy:)You were just a little kid.

21
00:00:47,594 --> 00:00:48,934
(Amy:)A little kid
who picked the wrong format

22
00:00:49,096 --> 00:00:51,006
(Sheldon:)to record The MacNeil/Lehrer Report

23
00:00:53,066 --> 00:00:57,246
(Sheldon:)I also was certain that HD DVD
would win out over Blu-ray.

24
00:00:57,404 --> 00:01:01,024
(Amy:)-How old were you then?
-Old enough to know better.

